<SiteLayout title="About LeadsFlo | Marketing, Development & Automation" description="Discover the thinking behind LeadsFlo: performance marketing, creative, websites, e-commerce, custom software and connected automation, built around real business goals." path="/about/">
<section class="lf-page-hero"><div class="container lf-hero-inner"><div class="lf-hero-copy"><p class="section-kicker">ABOUT LEADSFLO</p><h1>Good marketing is only part of the picture.</h1><p class="lf-lede">LeadsFlo brings marketing, creative, web development, automation &amp; systems together. Whether the goal is generating qualified inquiries, selling online or making day-to-day operations run more smoothly, we look at the business challenge first and build the right solution around it.</p><a href="/contact/" class="button button-primary">Tell us about your business <span>↗</span></a></div><aside class="lf-hero-aside"><span>WHAT DEFINES US</span><strong>Strategy, execution and technology working as one.</strong><span class="lf-aside-mark">↗</span></aside></div></section>
<AboutVisual />
<section class="lf-page-section lf-section-muted"><div class="container"><div class="lf-section-head"><p class="section-kicker">OUR FOCUS</p><h2>Different challenges. The right mix of skills.</h2></div><div class="lf-detail-grid"><article class="lf-detail-card"><span class="lf-card-index">01</span><h3>Marketing that serves the goal</h3><p>From lead-generation campaigns to e-commerce acquisition, the starting point is understanding the customer, the offer and what a successful outcome looks like.</p></article><article class="lf-detail-card"><span class="lf-card-index">02</span><h3>More than a website or funnel</h3><p>We design and build websites, stores, landing pages and custom applications, and connect them with the systems needed to support the business.</p></article><article class="lf-detail-card"><span class="lf-card-index">03</span><h3>Systems that support the work</h3><p>CRM workflows, AI agents, analytics and integrations should make work easier and decisions clearer—not add complexity for its own sake.</p></article></div></div></section>
<section class="lf-page-section"><div class="container lf-split"><div class="lf-sticky-head"><p class="section-kicker">WHO WE WORK WITH</p><h2>Built for businesses with something to grow.</h2></div><div class="lf-prose"><h3>Services and appointment-driven businesses</h3><p>For businesses built around inquiries, consultations and booked appointments, we connect advertising, landing pages, follow-up and sales handoffs.</p><h3>E-commerce and online brands</h3><p>Product-led businesses need a different approach: compelling creative, useful shopping experiences, conversion-focused stores and campaign measurement tied to sales.</p><h3>Teams that need more than a template</h3><p>When the challenge involves a custom website, a disconnected toolset or a manual process, we can combine software development and automation with marketing execution.</p></div></div></section>

<section class="lf-page-section lf-founder-visual" aria-labelledby="lf-founder-heading"><div class="container lf-founder-visual__grid"><div class="lf-founder-visual__photo"><img src="/work/founder-cary-wood.webp" alt="Cary Wood, founder of LeadsFlo" loading="lazy" decoding="async" /></div><div class="lf-founder-visual__copy"><p class="section-kicker">MEET THE FOUNDER</p><h2 id="lf-founder-heading">Built from experience on both sides of the work.</h2><p>LeadsFlo was founded by Cary Wood, whose background spans more than 13 years in sales, digital marketing and hands-on client delivery. Working across different businesses has shaped a practical view: a strong campaign means little if the website, customer experience or follow-through cannot support it.</p><p>Alongside marketing, Cary builds websites, applications and automation systems. That blend of commercial experience and technical execution informs how LeadsFlo approaches each project—starting with the problem, choosing the right tools and staying focused on the result.</p><a class="button button-primary" href="/contact/">Discuss your project ↗</a></div></div></section>
<style>.lf-founder-visual{background:#f3f6fc}.lf-founder-visual__grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(260px,.85fr) minmax(0,1.15fr);align-items:center;gap:clamp(28px,6vw,90px)}.lf-founder-visual__photo{border-radius:20px;overflow:hidden;max-width:460px;background:#e6ebf3}.lf-founder-visual__photo img{width:100%;height:auto;display:block;max-height:560px;object-fit:cover;object-position:center top}.lf-founder-visual__copy h2{font-size:clamp(29px,3.5vw,48px);line-height:1.14;letter-spacing:-.045em;margin:14px 0 22px}.lf-founder-visual__copy p:not(.section-kicker){line-height:1.75;color:#516078;margin-bottom:18px}.lf-founder-visual__copy .button{margin-top:12px}@media(max-width:750px){.lf-founder-visual__grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}.lf-founder-visual__photo{max-width:360px}}</style>
<section class="lf-end-cta"><div class="container lf-cta-inner"><div><p class="section-kicker">START HERE</p><h2>Have a business challenge worth solving?</h2></div><a href="/contact/" class="button button-primary">Start a conversation <span>↗</span></a></div></section>
</SiteLayout>